https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X11_color_names]X11 color names[/url] with the addition of [constant TRANSPARENT]. GDScript also provides [method @GDScript.Color8], which uses integers from [code]0[/code] to [code]255[/code] and doesn't support overbright colors.\n+\t\tColor data may be stored in many color spaces and encodings. The [method srgb_to_linear] and [method linear_to_srgb] functions can convert between nonlinear sRGB encoding and linear RGB encoding.","path":"doc/classes/Color.xml","commit_id":"f6515161e1b18ba40554573248c81887432a9b2b","original_commit_id":"0624dc94f785aa08ba7e4bfd95d9a073102de5b9","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"🤷 Nitpick\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\tColor data may be stored in many color spaces and encodings. The [method srgb_to_linear] and [method linear_to_srgb] methods can convert between nonlinear sRGB encoding and linear RGB encoding.\r\n```","created_at":"2025-04-09T08:13:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T08:14:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104410#discussion_r2034754124","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote